From d9675b5a835022132886e9c866dcf0e1734e9074 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:26:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(mail): assistant mail_clear_captured behind the
 approval card with a stale-count guard (bt2-todos clear-all-tool)

Previews the count on the card every time, deletes only this workspace's captured test
emails after approval, and refuses when new test emails arrived after the preview.
Batch opt-out pending in AVOID batch-tool-inputs.ts (WAIT-M19).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
